title: "vmkit attaches raw host block devices as VM disks, bypassing APFS"
tags: [interesting, vm, vmkit, macos]
links:
  - label: vmkit README
    href: https://github.com/indexable-inc/index/blob/main/packages/vm/vmkit/README.md
  - label: issue #3554
